WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Draw two starting strands. Use Create to draw one orange and one gold strand.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Add the four connected arms. Use Attach at each free endpoint to extend the laces.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Position the ends. Use Move to arrange the arms around the centre.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Lock the final crossing. Select orange 1_2 over gold 2_3 with Weave.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
One box stitch, one level. Explore the finished stitch in 3D. No extra levels yet.

